     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCENARIO-01\"> </a></b>Create workflow narratives</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can create high-level narratives based on the actual context the majority of end users operate in.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCENARIO-02\"> </a></b>Illustrate typical interactions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can illustrate user scenarios depicting typical interactions (screening, diagnosis, treatment, reporting).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCENARIO-03\"> </a></b>Include complex scenarios</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can include scenarios that are intricate in terms of normative guidance where helpful for understanding.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCENARIO-04\"> </a></b>Align with business processes</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can ensure user scenario narratives align with the sequence of activities depicted in business process workflows.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-SCENARIO-01\"> </a></b>Create workflow narratives</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can create high-level narratives based on the actual context the majority of end users operate in.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-SCENARIO-02\"> </a></b>Illustrate typical interactions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can illustrate user scenarios depicting typical interactions (screening, diagnosis, treatment, reporting).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-SCENARIO-03\"> </a></b>Include complex scenarios</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can include scenarios that are intricate in terms of normative guidance where helpful for understanding.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-SCENARIO-04\"> </a></b>Align with business processes</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can ensure user scenario narratives align with the sequence of activities depicted in business process workflows.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorUserScenarios\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-SCENARIO-01\"> </a></b>Create workflow narratives</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can create high-level narratives based on the actual context the majority of end users operate in.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-SCENARIO-02\"> </a></b>Illustrate typical interactions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can illustrate user scenarios depicting typical interactions (screening, diagnosis, treatment, reporting).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"